      "en": "Moses did as the LORD commanded him; and the congregation was assembled at the door of the Tent of Meeting.",
      "ko": "모세가 여호와께서 자기에게 명하신대로 하매 회중이 회막 문에 모인지라",
      "source_text_hash": "133fd2040d1fbc6c3aefc15c99db88d879dfbb5347560e22877d6039f5e39e50",
      "translation_text_hash": "ac14184139da3d366b959a40a757e305c9eca253b980fcd3bf86185da447c93a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "모세가 여호와께서 자기에게 명하신대로 하매 회중이 회막 문에 모인지라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "ac14184139da3d366b959a40a757e305c9eca253b980fcd3bf86185da447c93a"
      ]
