      "en": "Moses said to the congregation, “This is the thing which the LORD has commanded to be done.”",
      "ko": "모세가 회중에게 이르되 여호와께서 행하라고 명하신 것이 이러하니라 하고",
      "source_text_hash": "6156c3c3c9af4a9df593ac9352a4e233bfe9b310d57619e3403809a7e0b12846",
      "translation_text_hash": "50945c5f7e0f48633a706b728a36fb026a382ee66de6ffdb079306bf3aaa0f61",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "모세가 회중에게 이르되 여호와께서 행하라고 명하신 것이 이러하니라 하고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "50945c5f7e0f48633a706b728a36fb026a382ee66de6ffdb079306bf3aaa0f61"
      ]
    },
