      "en": "You shall not go out from the door of the Tent of Meeting for seven days, until the days of your consecration are fulfilled: for he shall consecrate you seven days.",
      "ko": "위임식은 칠일 동안 행하나니 위임식이 마치는 날까지 칠일 동안은 회막문에 나가지 말라",
      "source_text_hash": "bf110307119a469fab2e8940512eb9b49f4af2a0554f838aaa7e7f82d7a90560",
      "translation_text_hash": "b8d6d911c49fc126d0fa7739bcccbc8f6c1b4ae4fff49a8d57e6699f6a7c3eba",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
